  "description": "“I'm not going to marry that XX guy.\" \n\nBecause of her sister's defiant refusal, it was up to Hye-ri, the illegitimate daughter of Chairman Lee, to attend the matchmaking date with the infamous man. He was said to be hideously ugly, with a violent personality, who liked to bully people. Some even say that he's mentally unstable. Amidst all the unsavory rumors, her potential matchmaking mate is indeed a very \"dangerous husband.\" \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
